# Copy values into GitHub → Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions
#
# === Preferred: RDP / self-hosted runner ===
# 1) RDP into TezHost Windows server as Administrator
# 2) Create runner token in GitHub → Settings → Actions → Runners → New self-hosted runner
# 3) Run: scripts\install-github-runner.ps1 -RepoUrl https://github.com/coditiumsolutions/POS_MT -RegistrationToken <token>
# 4) Set variable IIS_SITE_PATH (and optional IIS_APP_POOL / IIS_SITE_NAME)
# 5) Run workflow: Deploy TezHost (RDP / Self-hosted)
#
# Secrets (sensitive):
CONNECTION_STRING=Server=tcp:YOUR_SQL;Database=POS_MT;User Id=...;Password=...;TrustServerCertificate=True;Encrypt=False;MultipleActiveResultSets=true;Connect Timeout=30
CONNECTION_STRING_CENTRAL=
CONNECTION_STRING_OFFLINE=Data Source=App_Data/pos-offline.db
SITE_HEALTH_URL=https://yourdomain.com/Account/Login
#
# FTPS-only secrets (optional alternative workflow):
FTP_SERVER=ftp.yourdomain.com
FTP_USERNAME=your-ftp-user
FTP_PASSWORD=your-ftp-password

# Variables (non-secret):
# IIS_SITE_PATH=C:\inetpub\wwwroot\pos
# IIS_APP_POOL=POS_MT
# IIS_SITE_NAME=POS_MT
# FTP_REMOTE_DIR=/httpdocs/
# FTP_PROTOCOL=ftps
# FTP_PORT=21
# FTP_VERIFY_CERT=no
# POS_HUB_MODE=Standard
# SHOP_NAME=Main Shop
# ALLOWED_HOSTS=*
# SELF_CONTAINED=false
